Israeli election results won’t change its expansionist nature of regime: Lebanese MP 

A Lebanese legislator says the final results of Israel’s legislative elections, which are the first since the October 7 attacks and genocidal war in the Gaza Strip, will not make any changes in the expansionist nature of the Tel Aviv regime.

