Four Palestinians killed, dozens wounded in fresh Israeli attacks across Gaza

Fresh Israeli attacks have killed four Palestinians and wounded dozens more across the Gaza Strip, including children, as Israeli forces continued shooting, artillery shelling, drone operations, and demolitions in several areas.

